<p>Hi <%= @user.name %>,</p>

<p>You requested to change your email address on <%= Branding.contextual_app_name %>.</p>

<p>Please confirm your new email address by clicking the link below:</p>

<p style="text-align: center; margin: 28px 0;">
  <%= link_to "Confirm new email address", @confirmation_url, style: "display: inline-block; background-color: #2563eb; color: #ffffff; padding: 12px 32px; border-radius: 8px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600; font-size: 15px;" %>
</p>

<p style="color: #9b9a97; font-size: 13px;">This link will expire in 24 hours. If you did not request this change, you can safely ignore this email.</p>
